By adding an additional filter, the engineering request (ER) number (which is published in the Engineering Tracking System - ETS), the user will be able to quickly and easily retrieve drawings and document for a given engineering scope under which an ER number exists.', N'Easier searching/retrieval of documents', 10342, N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/7410.jpeg', N'The ability to search and retrieve document for a specific scope is often challenging, with limited filters able to be set (largely limited to WBS area, discipline, drawing type, and title - where the titles are often general and broad). As a result, much time can be spend trying to locate documents using different variations of filters and keywords
