', N'Correct all component and BOM issues with the Primary cyclones', 10096, N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/7903.jpeg', N'The primary cyclone BOM was not correct and contained components associated with the copper cyclones, leading to confusion in material stock and assembly.
The cyclones were also modified in fall 2025, in which the BOM was not properly modified to reflect the changes.
The component list associated with the overhaul PM for the cyclones was incorrect, which lead to suspicion of improper assembly due to the high particle size measured downstream in the floatation circuit.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/7903.jpeg', N'Full analysis of the cyclones with the vendor (Weir) to ensure that the parts stocked were all current and updated in SAP. ', NULL, N'Successful resolution', N'Ensure proper workflow assignment for BOM updates', 0, NULL, N'REDUÇÃO DE ACIONAMENTOS INCORRETOS DOS SWITCHS NA ESCADA PRINCIPAL.', '2026-01-30T00:00:00.000', '2026-02-02T09:06:12.000', 81037527, NULL, 1);
