', N'Improve user experience, address security vulnerability, reduce cost', 0, N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/8151.jpeg', N'To remotely access OT environments would require use of Broadcom PAM deployed in Sudbury, Thompson, Long Harbour, Port Colborne and Thompson.
